id=zygisknext_lsposed_srb_guard
name=Zygisk Next/LSPosed Soft-Reboot Guard
version=v0.2.0
versionCode=2
author=slapah
description=Kills the stale LSPosed (lspd) daemon during a KernelSU emulated soft reboot so the replacement service stage starts a single clean lspd instead of a double daemon. Zygisk Next handles its own injector across the soft reboot, so this guard leaves it alone.
